#. i18n: file: data/effects/avfilter/avfilter_erosion.xml
#: rc.cpp:5678 rc.cpp:5682 rc.cpp:5686 rc.cpp:5690 rc.cpp:5842 rc.cpp:5846
#: rc.cpp:5850 rc.cpp:5854
#, kde-format
